#: connectdialog.ui:20
msgid ""
"Pick the device you want to connect from the list below. If your device is not in the list, assure yourself it is already turned on and connected to the PC, and then click \"Scan Devices\".\n"
"If you are sure your device is connected and is not shown in the list, you can try \"Manual Connection\""
msgstr ""
"Bitte nerrn op de List de Reedschap utsöken, na de Du Di tokoppeln wullt. Is de Reedschap nich op de List, beseker bitte, dat is anmaakt un den Reekner tokoppelt, un klick op \"Reedschappen dörkieken\".\n"
"Büst Du seker, de Reedschap is tokoppelt, un warrt liekers nich op de List wiest, kannst Du \"Vun Hand tokoppeln\" utproberen."

